### ─────────────────────────────────────────
###  LOCATIONS  (/api/locations)   [AuthGuard required]
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Create Location  [SuperAdminGuard]
POST http://localhost:3000/api/locations/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "depotName": "Montreal Depot",
    "address": "1000 Rue de la Gauchetière, Montreal, QC",
    "phoneNumber": "514-555-0100"
}

### Get All Locations
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations/all

### Get All Vehicles From Location
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations/1/vehicles

### Update Location  [AdminGuard]
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/locations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "depotName": "Montreal Depot North",
    "address": "1200 Rue Saint-Denis, Montreal, QC",
    "phoneNumber": "514-555-0199",
    "lon": -73.5673,
    "lat": 45.5017
}

### Add Vehicle to Location  [AdminGuard]
POST http://localhost:3000/api/locations/addVehicle
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "vehicleId": 2,
    "locationId": 1
}

### Remove Vehicle From Location  [AdminGuard]
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/locations/removeVehicle
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "locationId": 1,
    "vehicleId": 2
}

### Delete Location  [SuperAdminGuard]
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/locations/1
